arrier initiatives that have changed the industry. We ended annual service contracts, overages, unpredictable international roaming fees and data buckets, among other things. We are inspired by a relentless focus on customer experience, consistently delivering award-winning customer experience, which drives our customer s","zh":"身為美國實力強勁的非營運商，我們積極與客戶互動、傾聽客戶的意見並專注於消除他們的痛點，從而顛覆了電信業。我們相信，我們的客戶將受益於最佳價值和最佳網路的無與倫比的結合，同時堅定不移地致力於為他們提供盡可能最佳的服務體驗，以及對無線及其他領域顛覆性創新的無可爭議的推動力。這包括提供附加價值和我們認為的卓越體驗，同時實施改變行業的標誌性 Un-carrier 計劃。我們終止了年度服務合約、超額服務、不可預測的國際漫遊費和數據流量等。我們對客戶體驗的不懈關注，始終如一地提供屢獲殊榮的客戶體驗，這推動了我們的客戶"},{"en":"With what we believe is America's best network, with the largest, fastest, most awarded and most advanced 5G network, the Un-carrier strives to offer customers unrivaled coverage and capacity where they live, work and travel. We believe our network is the foundation of our success and powers everything we do. Our dense and multi-layer network provides an unmatched 5G and overall network experience to our customers, which consists of our foundational layer of low-band, mid-band and millimeter-wave (\"mmWave\") spectrum licenses (see \"Spectrum Position\" below). This multilayer portfolio of spectrum broadens and deepens our nationwide 5G network, enabling accelerated innovation and increased competition in the U.S. wireless telecommunications industry.","zh":"憑藉我們認為是美國最好的網路，以及最大、最快、獲獎最多和最先進的 5G 網路，Un-Carrier 致力於為客戶的生活、工作和旅行提供無與倫比的覆蓋範圍和容量。我們相信我們的人脈是我們成功的基礎，並為我們所做的一切提供動力。我們密集的多層網路為我們的客戶提供了無與倫比的 5G 和整體網路體驗，其中包括我們的低頻段、中頻段和毫米波 (“mmWave”) 頻譜許可的基礎層（請參閱下面的“頻譜位置”）。這種多層頻譜組合拓寬並深化了我們的全國 5G 網路，從而加速了美國無線電信行業的創新並加劇了競爭。"},{"en":"We continue to expand the footprint and improve the quality of our network, enabling us to provide what we believe are outstanding wireless experiences for customers who should not have to compromise on quality and value. Our network allows us to deliver new, innovative products and services, such as our 5G broadband fixed wireless product, with the same customer experience focus and industry-disrupting mindset that we have adopted in our journey to redefine wireless communications services in the United States in the customers' favor.","zh":""}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We provide wireless communications and broadband services to a variety of customers needing connectivity, but focus primarily on two categories of customers:","zh":""},{"en":"Postpaid customers generally are qualified to pay after receiving service utilizing phones, 5G broadband gateways, fiber connections, mobile internet devices (including tablets and hotspots), wearables, DIGITS and other connected devices (including SyncUP and internet of things (\"IoT\")). We serve consumers as well as business customers, who are provided services under the T-Mobile for Business brand.","zh":""}],"competition":[{"en":"The telecommunications industry remains competitive. We are the second largest provider of wireless communications services in the U.S. as measured by our total postpaid and prepaid customers. Our wireless communications services competitors include other carriers, such as AT&T Inc. (\"AT&T\") and Verizon Communications, Inc. (\"Verizon\"). In addition, our wireless communications services competitors include numerous smaller and regional providers, including Charter Communications, Inc., Comcast Corporation, EchoStar Corporation (\"EchoStar\"), Cox Communications, Inc., and Altice USA, Inc., many of which offer no-contract, postpaid and prepaid service plans. Competitors also include providers who offer similar communication services, such as voice, messaging and data services, using alternative technologies. In addition to our wireless communications services, our broadband services compete ","zh":""},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, we employed approximately 75,000 full-time and part-time employees, including network, retail, administrative and customer support functions.","zh":""}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":71306000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Branded Postpaid Revenue","val":57932000000,"zh":"品牌後付費收入"},{"name":"Branded Postpaid Revenue Phone","val":49443000000,"zh":"品牌後付費收益電話"},{"name":"Product Equipment","val":15972000000,"zh":"產品設備"},{"name":"Branded Prepaid Revenue","val":10497000000,"zh":"品牌預付費收入"},{"name":"Branded Postpaid Revenue Other","val":8489000000,"zh":"品牌後付費收入 其他"},{"name":"Wholesale & Other Service Revenue","val":2877000000,"zh":"批發及其他服務收入"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":1031000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":88309000000}},"peers":["CMCSA","CHTR","AMT","S","MA"]}}